Package: bayesm.HART
Title: Bayesian Multinomial Logit Models with HART Priors
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Thomas", "Wiemann", , "wiemann@uchicago.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements Metropolis-within-Gibbs samplers for Bayesian
  hierarchical multinomial logit, linear, and negative binomial models with the
  normalized and direct HART priors developed in Wiemann (2025). Originally a
  fork of the bayesm and BART R packages.
